{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35640","headline":"曲江二首 二 · 李山甫","name":"曲江二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"江色沈天万草齐，暖烟晴霭自相迷。\n蜂怜杏蕋细香落，莺坠柳条浓翠低。\n千队国娥轻似雪，一羣公子醉如泥。\n斜阳怪得长安动，陌上分飞万马蹄。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李山甫","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35640.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35640","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}